 --> 00:00:15,608\nit gave me the tools to do this. It was easy\n\n5\n00:00:15,624 --> 00:00:19,384\nenough to consume, but it covered enough detail\n\n6\n00:00:19,552 --> 00:00:23,192\nto answer my questions and get me on the right track with all\n\n7\n00:00:23,216 --> 00:00:26,866\nthe preparation, planning, and then actually executing it.\n\n8\n00:00:27,018 --> 00:00:30,386\nSo I've now launched my membership and Build a Beloved\n\n9\n00:00:30,418 --> 00:00:34,418\nMembership was invaluable for making me feel prepared\n\n10\n00:00:34,514 --> 00:00:37,986\nfor doing that. And I'm confident that it stopped\n\n11\n00:00:38,018 --> 00:00:40,390\nme from making critical mistakes.\n\n12\n00:00:41,130 --> 00:00:45,170\nSo I'm also a member of the Lab. And so I paired\n\n13\n00:00:45,330 --> 00:00:49,074\ndoing Build a Beloved Membership with a hot seat with Jay.\n\n14\n00:00:49,202 --> 00:00:52,514\nAnd this was brilliant because it just further validated my idea\n\n15\n00:00:52,562 --> 00:00:55,750\nand allowed me to just get some critical feedback to make\n\n16\n00:00:55,790 --> 00:00:59,606\nsure that everything was, I guess, as I thought it,\n\n17\n00:00:59,758 --> 00:01:03,558\nthat it would be, and that I didn't need to change my strategy.\n\n18\n00:01:03,734 --> 00:01:06,310\nAnd actually, there were some things for me to consider and\n\n19\n00:01:06,350 --> 00:01:10,486\nimplement as a result of that. So if you're considering joining\n\n20\n00:01:10,518 --> 00:01:14,374\nor taking Build a Beloved Membership and creating a membership\n\n21\n00:01:14,422 --> 00:01:17,490\nyourself, then I would highly recommend it.\n\n22\n00:01:17,790 --> 00:01:21,174\nEverything from scoping out of the membership\n\n23\n00:01:21,222 --> 00:01:24,960\nitself, working through pricing, understanding the\n\n24\n00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:28,592\ntime commitments and the time frames for launching the\n\n25\n00:01:28,616 --> 00:01:29,800\nmembership. It's all.\n\n","transcript":"I worked my way through Build a Beloved Membership when I was considering creating a nutrition membership for triathletes. And it was brilliant because it gave me the tools to do this. It was easy enough to consume, but it covered enough detail to answer my questions and get me on the right track with all the preparation, planning, and then actually executing it. So I've now launched my membership and Build a Beloved Membership was invaluable for making me feel prepared for doing that. And I'm confident that it stopped me from making critical mistakes. So I'm also a member of the Lab. And so I paired doing Build a Beloved Membership with a hot seat with Jay. And this was brilliant because it just further validated my idea and allowed me to just get some critical feedback to make sure that everything was, I guess, as I thought it, that it would be, and that I didn't need to change my strategy. And actually, there were some things for me to consider and implement as a result of that. So if you're considering joining or taking Build a Beloved Membership and creating a membership yourself, then I would highly recommend it. Everything from scoping out of the membership itself, working through pricing, understanding the time commitments and the time frames for launching the membership. It's all."},"original_asset_id":null,"modified_start_seconds":null,"original_asset":null},"collection_items":[{"id":"a955b64a-0db3-4a5d-a885-b7ae012313d0","created_at":"2025-04-22 10:21:55.213+00","collection_id":"d7bdf3a1-52a8-4254-964c-70b7cd29cee4","review_id":"8ddefbdf-7e29-4e59-b859-e8de6270658c","added_manually":false}],"translations":[],"form_responses":[{"id":"894acb22-f7a1-4dc4-bd27-b2cbe2a96e45","type":"video","text":"","attachments":[],"asset_id":"bd229b12-2734-4e36-b9d2-a5a122e834ba","form_question_id":"54262c28-c8b4-4e41-9e0f-4d782eb35cb6","review_id":"8ddefbdf-7e29-4e59-b859-e8de6270658c","created_at":"2026-05-03 21:48:58.633403+00","original_question_text":"Share a testimonial","primar